//! - `admission-clones-upstream-dispatch-for-bit-order` (category D —
//!   candidate 2): gather_qmm_nax.zig:59-63 — clone the framework's own
//!   kernel-family predicate (`B >= 16 && B / E >= 4`), because below it the
//!   framework sums in another order and MTP verify rounds must keep its bits.
