//!   candidate 3): lane_qmm.zig:5-11,350-356 + simd_qmm.zig:399-404,587-588,
//!   633-672 — the K-slice count is a function of the weight's shape only, so
//!   a drafted window verifies with the one-row step's bits; a per-shape probe
